## Anatomy

<CodeBlock code={anatomy} filename="App.svelte" />

## API reference

### NumberField.Root

<ApiTable props={rootProps} />

`NumberField.Input` is a `role="spinbutton"` textbox with `aria-valuenow/min/max`; it parses on commit (change, blur, Enter) and reverts invalid text. `Increment`/`Decrement` step within bounds and disable themselves at the edges. Pairs with `Field` for label, description, and custom validation.

## Keyboard interactions

- <Kbd>↑</Kbd><Kbd>↓</Kbd> step by `step`; <Kbd>PgUp</Kbd> / <Kbd>PgDn</Kbd> step by `largeStep`.
- <Kbd>Home</Kbd> / <Kbd>End</Kbd> jump to min/max (when bounded).
- <Kbd>Enter</Kbd> commits the typed text.
